      *> WS-STATUS - generated by PowerRustCOBOL AI; written once, never overwritten.
      *> Copy it inside the RETURNING record of an exported program:
      *>     01 PAY-RESULT.
      *>         COPY "../COPYBOOKS/WS-STATUS".
      *> and name the group in backend/exports.toml:  status = "WS-STATUS".
      *> Code 0 is success; 1 to 7999 is the program's own failure code.
           05 WS-STATUS.
               10 WS-STATUS-CODE                   PIC 9(4)    VALUE 0.
               10 WS-STATUS-MESSAGE                PIC X(200)  VALUE SPACES.
               10 WS-STATUS-DETAIL                 PIC X(1000) VALUE SPACES.
